  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace and Conflict Resolution Evidence Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver a new UK research and data platform to track conflict and its resolution, using technology (e.g. data analytics and Artificial Intelligence (AI)) and working with research partners in conflict affected countries. The programme will deliver world class research and provide &#x2018;rapid response&#x2019; data and expertise for FCDO and our global partners which will help inform policies.</narrative>
  </description>
